ons","owned":false},{"alias":"S0832","text":",","owned":false},{"alias":"S0833","text":"which affects the reliability of PPPs The paper showcases this issue by presenting several examples taken","owned":false},{"alias":"S0834","text":".","owned":false},{"alias":"S0835","text":"from the ICP 2017 cycle","owned":false},{"alias":"S0836","text":".","owned":false},{"alias":"S0837","text":"An alternative solution would be through similarity linking choosing five pairs of countries between the five","owned":false},{"alias":"S0838","text":",","owned":false},{"alias":"S0839","text":"ICP regions with the highest matching price data between them The problem is that determining which pairs","owned":false},{"alias":"S0840","text":".","owned":false},{"alias":"S0841","text":"of countries would be optimal for interregional linking is a difficult task","owned":true,"scope":"document_body","tableDepth":0,"inTableOfContents":false,"style":{"Bold":false,"Italic":false,"RelativeFontSize":"body","LineCount":1},"numbering":{},"markers":[],"attention":true},{"alias":"S0842","text":".","owned":true,"scope":"table","tableDepth":0,"inTableOfContents":false,"style":{"Bold":false,"Italic":false,"RelativeFontSize":"body","LineCount":1},"numbering":{},"markers":[],"attention":true},{"alias":"S0843","text":"\u201C","owned":true,"scope":"quoted_replacement","tableDepth":0,"inTableOfContents":false,"style":{"Bold":false,"Italic":false,"RelativeFontSize":"body","LineCount":1},"numbering":{},"markers":[],"attention":true},{"alias":"S0844","text":"Yuri Dikhanov World Bank presented a paper under the title Fisher versus T\u00F6rnqvist when Relative Price","owned":true,"scope":"quoted_replacement","tableDepth":0,"inTableOfContents":false,"style":{"Bold":false,"Italic":false,"RelativeFontSize":"body","LineCount":1},"numbering":{},"markers":[],"attention":true},{"alias":"S0845","text":", ,","owned":true,"scope":"quoted_replacement","tableDepth":0,"inTableOfContents":false,"style":{"Bold":false,"Italic":fals